# Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded hyperbolic sine of BF16
#
# x = x1 + x2, where x1 keeps the exponent and the upper 4 bits of the mantissa of |x| and x2 the exponent and the
# lower 3 bits: sinh(x1 + x2) = sinh(x1) cosh(x2) + cosh(x1) sinh(x2), all four tabulated as B32 values whose
# combination rounds correctly to BF16. The same tables serve BF16.cosh and BF16.tanh. Round to nearest only: +-0
# and +-inf map to themselves, overflow gives a signed infinity, NaN comes back quiet.
#
# Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binaryb16/sinh/sinh_bf16.c.
# Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
# MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module Standard/System/Numerics/BF16

